<title>JAPAN: Makita - 6mth group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Makita - 6mth group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 88.50		vs	   74.34</p>
<p> Current		6.95		vs	    6.48</p>
<p> Net		    3.36		vs	    3.17</p>
<p> EPS		   20.10 yen	  vs	   19.07 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Makita Corp is a major electric tool maker. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
